      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's not any significant amount. Not even enough to rank up out of visitor rank. Increased trust just simply means adding a couple trust points to your account as it takes to level up between ranks. It's the exact same as adding friends \"increases your trust\", and uploading avatar \"increases your trust\". It's just a little thing. Nothing substantial at all",
