      "value": "@{5ba5d139dabace1d8df9df6f|full_name}: I went from New User to User immediately upon purchase and so did my friend Dawsy and he has only 20hrs in the game with no uploaded content and 10 friends, so what you're saying is literally untrue. Not to mention I have 80 hours and I am a known user. Everyone else who I have spoken to has had at least 200+ hours and content uploaded to get Known.\nIncreased Trust should NOT have been included in the purchase of VRC+ because MONEY does NOT equal TRUST.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
