      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If someone **pays** for VRChat... that makes them more trustworthy, doesn't it? They have more to lose if they get banned. So they're more likely to behave well.\nI don't see why this should be removed. It does not just benefit the user who pays, but everyone else as well. Because our safety setting will (correctly) assume that the user will behave and not abuse their avatar's allowed features.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
