      "value": "@{5ba5d139dabace1d8df9df6f|full_name}: ... just to quickly add to Jamie's response ... \nTo anyone concerned with the small (one-time) Trust bump coming with Plus, please also consider that users who makes payment are essentially binding their real identity during the transaction (at least to an extent)... This is an effective option for tracing (if required) and moderating any plus user who stupidly decides to troll or harrass... and I think plus users realise this as well.\nI genuinely don't see cause for any concern - in fact, I think it's a pretty savvy decision on VRC teams part ... this assists new visitors who desperatly want to rank up enough to contribute their ideas - while also bringing in some support revenue.\n* huzzuh *",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
