  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-21T22:34:22.625Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "User trust is such a strange thing. Currently it floats between an identifier of who has been around a while and who *might* be helpful if you need help, but it also serves as a target for trolls. All in all, though, trust rank has become ingrained in VRChat culture enough that adding an increase of trust for money kind of defeats the purpose of \"Trust\".",
